PLugin idea:
go to selected file
F1 -> Generate Resource
enter resource path: Info/TestResource
Info folder gets generated (if not present)
TestResource file gets generated, file is typed by typeof of selected file (or via type Main if present)
default generated file

return {
    Resource = {} :: typeof(selected file)
}


we can also make it so that genearted tokens are imported into a singular file
so that we could get tokens via singular require

local token = require(Internal.Info.TestResource)

return = {
    Info = {
        TestResource = token
    }
}

^ also will be autogenerated

when the app is created you will do this thing in the bootstraper

local tokens = require(Internal.Dependencies.Tokens)
local resource = require(selectedFile)

App:AddResource(tokens.Info.TestResource, resource)

^ Resource field of the generated token file gets replcated with the resource source

